hadiths[23]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1264","Hamein Musa bin Ismail ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Hammad bin Salama ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Sabit ne khabar di, Hazrat Anas se ke Bara bin Malik mardon ko haddi suna kar oont hankate the aur Anjasha aurton ko haddi suna kar oont hankate the aur woh khush awaz the, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Ai Anjasha, sheeshiyon ko hankane mein aahista kar."
"1265","Hamein Hafs bin Umar ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Khalid bin Abdullah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Ata bin al-Saib ne khabar di, Saeed bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas se, Allah Azza wa Jal ke is farman ke bare mein ke aur logon mein se koi hai jo behuda bat kharidta hai, unhon ne kaha: Gana aur us jaisi cheezein murad hain."
"1266","Hamein Muhammad bin Salam ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Fazari aur Abu Muawiya ne khabar di, un dono ne kaha: Hamein Qinan bin Abdullah al-Nahmi ne khabar di, Abdur Rahman bin Ausaja se, Bara bin Azib se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Salam ko phailao salamat rahoge aur takabbur se itarana shar hai. Abu Muawiya ne kaha: Asharah se murad abas hai."
"1267","Hamein Isam ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Hariz ne bayan kiya, Salman al-Alhani se, Fazala bin Ubaid se, aur woh majlison mein se ek majlis mein the, to unhein khabar pahunchi ke kuch log koba se khel rahe hain, to woh ghusse ki halat mein khare hue aur is se sakht tareen mana kiya, phir kaha: Khabardar, beshak is se khelne wala is ka juwa khata hai jaise khinzir ka gosht khane wala khata hai aur khoon se wuzu karne wala, koba se murad nard hai."
"1268","Hamein Ubaidullah bin Saeed ne bayan kiya, Qasim bin al-Hakam al-Qazi se, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Ubaidullah bin al-Walid al-Wassafi ne khabar di, Fuzail bin Muslim se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Ali raziyallahu anhu jab qasr ke darwaze se bahar nikalte aur nard walon ko dekhte to unhein le jate aur unhein subah se raat tak bandh kar qaid kar dete, to un mein se koi aadhe din tak qaid rehta. Unhon ne kaha: Aur jo raat tak qaid rehte woh woh the jo chandi ke sikkon par len den karte the aur jo aadhe din tak qaid rehte woh woh the jo is se dil behlate the, aur woh hukum dete the ke unhein salam na kiya jaye."
"1269","Hamein Ismail ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Malik ne bayan kiya, Musa bin Maisara se, Saeed bin Abi Hind se, Hazrat Abu Musa Ashari se ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jis ne nard se khela to us ne Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki nafarmani ki."
"1270","Hamein Musaddad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Mutamir ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abdul Malik se suna, Abul Ahwas se, Abdullah bin Masud se, unhon ne kaha: In do nishan zadah pason se bacho jinhein zor se phenka jata hai, pas beshak woh dono juwe mein se hain."
"1271","Hamein Muhammad bin Yusuf aur Qabisa ne bayan kiya, un dono ne kaha: Hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Alqama bin Marsad se, Ibn Buraida se, un ke walid se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, unhon ne farmaya: Jis ne nardsheer se khela to goya us ne apna hath khinzir ke gosht aur khoon mein ranga."
"1272","Hamein Ahmad bin Yunus aur Malik bin Ismail ne bayan kiya, un dono ne kaha: Hamein Zuhair ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Ubaidullah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Nafi ne bayan kiya, Saeed bin Abi Hind se, Abu Musa se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, unhon ne farmaya: Jis ne nard se khela to us ne Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki nafarmani ki."
"1273","Hamein Ismail ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Malik ne bayan kiya, Nafi se ke Abdullah bin Umar jab apne ghar walon mein se kisi ko nard khelta pate to use marte aur use tor dete."
"1274","Hamein Ismail ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Malik ne bayan kiya, Alqama bin Abi Alqama se, un ki walida se, Hazrat Ayesha raziyallahu anha se ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke un ke ghar mein ek gharane wale jo us mein rehte the un ke pas nard hai, to unhon ne un ki taraf paigham bheja ke agar tum ne ise na nikala to main tumhein apne ghar se nikal dungi, aur unhon ne is par un par sakht na pasandgi ka izhar kiya."
"1275","Hamein Musa ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Rabia bin Kulsum bin Jabr ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe mere walid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Ibn Zubair ne khutba diya to kaha: Ai Makkah walo, mujhe Quraish ke kuch aadmiyon ke bare mein khabar pahunchi hai jo ek khel khelte hain jise nardsheer kaha jata hai, aur woh bayan hath wale the, Allah ne farmaya: Beshak sharab aur juwa, aur beshak main Allah ki qasam khata hun ke mere pas jo shakhs laya gaya jo is se khele to main use us ke balon aur khal mein saza dunga aur jo ise mere pas layega use us ka saman de dunga."
"1276","Ibn us Sabbah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail bin Zakariya ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubaid bin Abi Umayya Hanafi se jo Tanafisi hain, unhon ne kaha: Yala Abu Murrah ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Hazrat Abu Huraira se suna, nard se juwa khelne wale ke bare mein: woh us ki tarah hai jo khinzir ka gosht khata hai, aur jo us se baghair juwe ke khelta hai woh us ki tarah hai jo apna hath khinzir ke khoon mein dubota hai, aur jo us ke paas baith kar us ki taraf dekhta hai woh us ki tarah hai jo khinzir ke gosht ki taraf dekhta hai."
"1277","Hasan bin Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid bin Zurai ne hum se bayan kiya, Habib se, Amr bin Shuaib se, un ke walid se, Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin al-Aas se, unhon ne farmaya: fussain se juwa khelne wala khinzir ka gosht khane wale ki tarah hai, aur jo un se baghair juwe ke khelta hai woh khinzir ke khoon mein apna hath dubone wale ki tarah hai."
"1278","Abdullah bin Saleh ne kaha: Lais ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yunus ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: Saeed bin al-Musayyib ne mujhe khabar di, ke Hazrat Abu Huraira ne unhen khabar di, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: momin ek surakh se do martaba nahi dasa jata."
"1279","Abdullah bin Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Saeed bin Abi Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya bin Abi Sulaiman ne mujh se bayan kiya, Saeed Maqburi se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, unhon ne farmaya: jis ne raat ko hum par mara woh hum mein se nahi. Abu Abdullah ne kaha: us ki sanad mein nazar hai."
"1280","Khalid bin Makhlad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Bilal ne hum se bayan kiya, Suhail bin Abi Saleh se, un ke walid se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: jis ne hum par hathyar uthaya woh hum mein se nahi."
"1281","Muhammad bin al-Ala ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Usama ne hum se bayan kiya, Buraid bin Abdullah bin Abi Burda se, Hazrat Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: jis ne hum par hathyar uthaya woh hum mein se nahi."
"1282","Yala bin Murrah rahimahullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: main ne Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu ko farmate hue suna, shatranj ko juwe ke sath khelne wale ke bare mein: woh khinzir ka gosht khane wale ki tarah hai, aur jo use baghair juwe ke khelta hai to woh khinzir ke khoon mein apna hath dubone wale ki tarah hai, aur jo us ke paas baith kar dekhta hai to woh khinzir ke gosht ki taraf dekhne wale ki tarah hai."
"1283","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin al-Aas raziyallahu anhuma se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: jo nard nardain se khelta hai to woh khinzir ka gosht khane wale ki tarah hai, aur jo un se baghair juwe ke khelta hai to woh khinzir ke khoon mein apna hath dubone wale ki tarah hai."
"1284","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: momin ek surakh se do martaba nahi dasa jata."
"1285","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: jis ne raat ko teer se hum par mara woh hum mein se nahi. Abu Abdullah Bukhari rahimahullah ne kaha: us ki sanad mahal e nazar hai."
"1286","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: jis ne hum par hathyar uthaya woh hum mein se nahi."
